{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/97fd5b15c25e26c072c7a222a2e2b007.poster.avif?t=1746013160\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/97fd5b15c25e26c072c7a222a2e2b007.webm?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/97fd5b15c25e26c072c7a222a2e2b007.mp4?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You have three different player modes at your disposal: shoot, sprint, and slide. Shoot mode equips your current weapon for firing. Sprint increases your movement speed. Slide allows you to maintain your momentum.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/49651000f9c84d9182689bd7f6f64be2.poster.avif?t=1746013160\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/49651000f9c84d9182689bd7f6f64be2.webm?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/49651000f9c84d9182689bd7f6f64be2.mp4?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you can see it, you can run on it. Every surface in the arena can be traversed allowing for a unique perspective on the 2D arena shooter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/8ed5e384aebf14ee7ce815a722f186e2.poster.avif?t=1746013160\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/8ed5e384aebf14ee7ce815a722f186e2.webm?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/8ed5e384aebf14ee7ce815a722f186e2.mp4?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shoot other players with your weapon, and don't worry you'll never run out of ammo. When you're hurt, grab a health nut to get back up to full health.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/95c91abf33955203511a0d1be1db667d.poster.avif?t=1746013160\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/95c91abf33955203511a0d1be1db667d.webm?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/extras/95c91abf33955203511a0d1be1db667d.mp4?t=1746013160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The way you move around the arena is only limited by your imagination. Utilize the weapons and mechanics to maneuver around and outsmart your opponents.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2771840?t=1746013160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2771840?t=1746013160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746013160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746013160","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/